This project was created for the Thales GenTech India Hackathon 2025.
Theme: Cybersecurity - Creating smart solutions to protect India's digital space.

The solution addresses:
- Cloud security and AI model safety
- Advanced persistent threat (APT) detection
- Multi-language threat intelligence for Indian digital infrastructure
- Automated incident response and threat containment

Built to protect India's digital future through AI-powered cybersecurity.
